nitize Option."},{"type":"Headline","text":"Frigidaire® 1.8 Cu. Ft. Over The Range Microwave - FMOS1846BS"},{"type":"Bullet","text":"Offers a clear, bright view of your cooktop with bright LED lighting."},{"type":"Bullet","text":"Take the guesswork out of knowing when to change your filter with the filter indicator light, programmed to alert you based off of ventilation fan usage."},{"type":"Bullet","text":"Over-the-range microwave doubles as a hood offering ventilation with two fan speeds."},{"type":"Bullet","text":"Large microwave that provides 1.8 cu. ft. of cooking space, easily accommodating almost any dish size."}],"documents":[{"label":"Refrigerator Owner's Manual","url":"https://linqcdn.avbportal.com/documents/f1104e89-b9d3-4046-867c-558bae7d73d4.pdf"},{"label":"Refrigerator Quick Start Guide","url":"https://linqcdn.avbportal.com/documents/9a5fe8a6-5d6d-4880-b9e1-46488f85a4f6.pdf"},{"label":"Refrigerator Installation Instructions","url":"https://linqcdn.avbportal.com/documents/0995a636-7027-439d-bd91-d56af3f89044.pdf"},{"label":"Refrigerator Energy Guide","url":"https://linqcdn.avbportal.com/documents/1f0c4747-7789-4a93-b27b-63d3932a9474.pdf"},{"label":"Refrigerator Specification Sheet","url":"https://linqcdn.avbportal.com/documents/169a3f11-ebe1-4edb-b267-2cf1cb8185d1.pdf"},{"label":"Dishwasher Energy Guide","url":"https://linqcdn.avbportal.com/documents/4c295786-adca-4a64-8167-cc1f0d8529d3.pdf"},{"label":"Dishwasher Installation Instructions","url":"https://linqcdn.avbportal.com/documents/9c20da2d-adf1-4ba9-ba10-96f448fae64e.pdf"},{"label":"Dishwasher Owner's Guide","url":"https://linqcdn.avbportal.com/documents/9338f754-ceda-4cbf-a5ab-d8e2dd553d33.pdf"},{"label":"Dishwasher Quick Start Guide","url":"https://linqcdn.avbportal.com/documents/1f383809-736d-4e0b-ac14-16f81a5cb6a0.pdf"},{"label":"Dishwasher Specification Sheet","url":"https://linqcdn.avbportal.com/documents/b9b8e8d6-575d-40d1-aed6-675d45d7d929.pdf"},{"label":"Microwave Installation Instructions